      {
        "padding": 0,
        "lineHeight": 1.5,
        "id": "markdown-2",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "We’re building NullDull to give that work a home. Tools…",
        "text": "We’re building NullDull to give that work a home. Tools for startups, usable by people and agents, with shared context and explicit permissions.",
