        "kind": "text",
        "name": "Memory holds the decisions, instructions, Markdown files,…",
        "text": "Memory holds the decisions, instructions, Markdown files, and private assets that help a team pick up where it left off. A workspace can keep shared guidance at its root, organize work under products, and add projects where more specific context belongs.",
